    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508430/extras/566848c3c9fb63f98a318bd6afe39d82.avif?t=1749307485\" data-has-big width=800 height=513 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;BlueLine&quot; is a thought-provoking visual narrative experience exploring the quest for happiness in the digital age. Step into the shoes of Blue, a Bangkok millennial grappling with the pressures of social media and the struggle to stay true to oneself. Perfect for those seeking a meaningful, story-rich and introspective gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508430/extras/ce3678a0dafae21cd43beaef62b9d86d.webp?t=1749307485\" width=223 height=25 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A slow-burning narrative with rising tension across multiple chapters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Themes of\u00a0self-worth, inner conflict, and the courage to reach out\u00a0in a relatable way.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508430/extras/0008a662429c911dd9dbd2c1b3330fdc.webp?t=1749307485\" width=243 height=25 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness Blue\u2019s\u00a0spiral\u00a0as he deals with\u00a0external expectations and internal conflict.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A\u00a0thought-provoking\u00a0portrayal of mental health and personal growth.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508430/extras/266d959c3e213aa6ef5867c4f43f7f7b.webp?t=1749307485\" width=284 height=25 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with characters who have\u00a0conflicting desires, pulling Blue in different directions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain relationships\u00a0through conversations, trips, and meaningful interactions.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508430/extras/1a6d07c7f1ede63a70f2d3982de54057.webp?t=1749307485\" width=209 height=25 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the pressures of modern life\u2014social media, expectations, and self-doubt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrolling feeds, overthinking, and navigating relationships</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508430/extras/25033e24c8636d312d7d6493339c1aa0.webp?t=1749307485\" width=262 height=25 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn animatic scenes\u00a0bring emotional moments to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Framing, color, and camera movement\u00a0used to enhance mood and storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautifully crafted scenery:\u00a0fireworks, clouds, flower fields, and more.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508430/extras/286dd36300a6864adfb06ef49e9bc2b1.webp?t=1749307485\" width=183 height=25 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore\u00a0Thailand\u2019s culture, landscapes, and daily life\u00a0through Blue\u2019s eyes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience\u00a0family dynamics and love\u00a0as part of the narrative.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508430/extras/912fa92cd2874f48ba0465134edc5a8e.webp?t=1749307485\" width=194 height=25 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A\u00a0peaceful, immersive\u00a0score that complements the introspective tone.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508430/extras/566848c3c9fb63f98a318bd6afe39d82.avif?t=1749307485\" data-has-big width=800 height=513 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;BlueLine&quot; is a thought-provoking visual narrative experience exploring the quest for happiness in the digital age. Step into the shoes of Blue, a Bangkok millennial grappling with the pressures of social media and the struggle to stay true to oneself. Perfect for those seeking a meaningful, story-rich and introspective gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508430/extras/ce3678a0dafae21cd43beaef62b9d86d.webp?t=1749307485\" width=223 height=25 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A slow-burning narrative with rising tension across multiple chapters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Themes of\u00a0self-worth, inner conflict, and the courage to reach out\u00a0in a relatable way.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508430/extras/0008a662429c911dd9dbd2c1b3330fdc.webp?t=1749307485\" width=243 height=25 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness Blue\u2019s\u00a0spiral\u00a0as he deals with\u00a0external expectations and internal conflict.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A\u00a0thought-provoking\u00a0portrayal of mental health and personal growth.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508430/extras/266d959c3e213aa6ef5867c4f43f7f7b.webp?t=1749307485\" width=284 height=25 /></span></h2><ul