ed.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508430/extras/912fa92cd2874f48ba0465134edc5a8e.webp?t=1749307485\" width=194 height=25 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A\u00a0peaceful, immersive\u00a0score that complements the introspective tone.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
